# GPU facts: gpu-admin-tools/gpu/devid_properties.py and gpu/devid_chips.py
# Mellanox PCI IDs: mstflint/kernel/mst_main.c
#
# Columns: VENDOR DEVICE SUBSYSTEM_VENDOR SUBSYSTEM_DEVICE KIND PROFILE ATTACHMENT
# VENDOR, DEVICE: PCI vendor and device IDs in hexadecimal, both required.
# SUBSYSTEM_VENDOR, SUBSYSTEM_DEVICE: hexadecimal IDs, or * for all variants.
# KIND: gpu, nic, switch, bridge, or other.
# PROFILE: descriptive device/chip name; register support is checked separately.
# ATTACHMENT: pcie (PCI Express), sxm (SXM), coherent (CPU-GPU C2C), or unknown.
# Sort numerically by all four identity columns, with * before exact IDs.
# Filename does not select a vendor. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
